# Mutation plan for the plugin API's configuration and licence methods (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md,
# Phase 6; D-990).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-api-config.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::the_plugin_api_config_methods_answer_as_go_answers` (23 API
# calls under a licensed pair, plus the `Plugins` each host left) and, for the licence mapping,
# `mm_app::plugin_api_config`'s one-hot unit test — the oracle licence and the fixture hold every
# flag `true`, so a swap between two flags is visible only there. The last two lines are the no-op
# controls and must SURVIVE.

